    "innovation": "This report provides a comprehensive overview of ocean acidification from increasing atmospheric CO2, synthesizing the chemical changes and biological impacts, particularly on calcifying organisms and coral reefs, and calling for urgent reductions in global emissions to prevent irreversible damage to marine ecosystems.",
